  "description": "ABUQUK crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H136 N8 Nd4 O11,3(C4 H8 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 4 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 5 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 5 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.471-4.346 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 77.01-153.70°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd4(μ3-O)2(μ2-OC4H8)(O2N2C19H32)4]·3THF. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
